          "name": "Error Stats",
          "type": "AnimationErrorStats&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Utility function to measure the accuracy of a compressed animation. Each end-effector is checked for\nworld-space movement as a result of compression.\n@param\tAnimSet\t\tThe animset to calculate compression error for.\n@param\tBoneData\tBoneData array describing the hierarchy of the animated skeleton\n@param\tErrorStats\tOutput structure containing the final compression error values\n@return\t\t\t\tNone."
